1
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:07,850
This blade has a dark past.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,650
It has shed much innocent blood.

3
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:19,000
You’re a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

4
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,600
You’re lucky your blood’s still flowing.

5
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,320
Thank you.

6
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,700
So…

7
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,000
What brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

8
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,980
I’m searching for someone.

9
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:39,300
Someone very dear?
A kindred spirit?

10
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:42,650
A dragon.

11
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,550
A dangerous quest for a lone hunter.

12
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,800
I’ve been alone for
as long as I can remember.
